00:01:27.588 --> 00:01:31.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PIERRE-ALEXANDRE BLOUIN, pdg,

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:33.327 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Asso. détaillants alimentation

00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:34.829 size:53% position:73% line:53%
